<title>USA: Signature Resorts names Depatie CFO.</title>
<headline>Signature Resorts names Depatie CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Signature Resorts Inc said Wednesday it had named Michael Depatie as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Before joining the company, Depatie served as chief financial officer of La Quinta Inns Inc.</p>
<p>Charles Frey will continue to oversee the company's accounting and other resort administration functions as senior vice president and treasurer, the company said.</p>
<p>Signature Resorts is one of the largest developers and operators of timeshare resorts in North America.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
